==German==

===Etymology===
{{root|de|ine-pro|*bʰuH-}}
From {{inh|de|gmh|būwen}}, from {{inh|de|goh|būan}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*būan}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*būaną}}, from {{der|de|ine-pro|*bʰúHt}}, the athematic root aorist of the root {{m|ine-pro|*bʰuH-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|[ˈbaʊ̯ən]}}
* {{audio|de|De-bauen.ogg}}
* {{audio|de|De-bauen2.ogg}}
* {{audio|de|De-at-bauen.ogg|a=Austria}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb}}

# {{lb|de|transitive}} to [[build]], to [[construct]], to [[create]]
#: {{ant|de|vernichten}}
# to [[rely]] {{+obj|de|:auf(acc)<on someone/something>}}
# {{lb|de|slang}} to [[roll]] a [[joint]]
#: {{ux|de|'''Baust''' du einen? Ich kann grad nicht mehr.|Can you '''roll''' one? I just can't anymore.}}
#* {{quote-song|1=de|author=AnnenMayKantereit|year=2018|title=Schon krass|album=Schlagschatten|url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rxj4_MCON4o|text=Meine Freunde haben all gezogen. / Ich hab '''gebaut''' und geraucht und gelogen. / Ich hab '''gebaut''' und geraucht.|t=My friends have all moved. / I've rolled and smoked and lied. / I've rolled and smoked.}}
# {{lb|de|informal|in certain idioms}}  to [[cause]] (something bad)
#: {{uxi|de|Mist/Scheiße '''bauen'''|to botch, to blunder}}
#: {{uxi|de|Unfall '''bauen'''|to '''cause''' an accident}}

